  "advice.SMALL_WINDOW.title": "Little natural light in {rn}", "advice.SMALL_WINDOW.why": "The windows add up to {win_m2}, which is {pct}% of the floor; at least 1/8 ({min_m2}) is recommended.", "advice.SMALL_WINDOW.fix": "Make the windows at least {add_mu} wider in total or add a window.",
