  "advice.DESK_GLARE.title": "The window is behind the desk chair ({rn})", "advice.DESK_GLARE.why": "Light from behind causes glare on the screen and tires your eyes.", "advice.DESK_GLARE.fix": "Turn the desk so the window is at the side, or add blinds.",
