  "care.lighting": "Use bulbs of the stated wattage; clean fittings only when off and cool.",
  "care.furniture.t": "Furniture",
  "care.furniture": "Tighten screws and hardware now and then; keep wood and textiles out of direct sun and away from heaters.",
  "advice.KITCHEN_TRIANGLE_LONG.title": "The kitchen work triangle is too large ({rn})",
  "advice.KITCHEN_TRIANGLE_LONG.why": "Sink – hob – fridge add up to {sum_m}, longest leg {long_m}; the NKBA guideline recommends at most 7.9 m in total and 1.2–2.7 m per leg, otherwise cooking takes many steps.",
  "advice.KITCHEN_TRIANGLE_LONG.fix": "Bring the fridge or the hob closer to the sink (move the cooker point or the fridge).",
  "advice.KITCHEN_TRIANGLE_SHORT.title": "Sink, hob and fridge are too cramped ({rn})",
  "advice.KITCHEN_TRIANGLE_SHORT.why": "One leg of the work triangle is {short_m}; NKBA recommends at least 1.2 m so there is worktop between them.",
  "advice.KITCHEN_TRIANGLE_SHORT.fix": "Leave at least one worktop module between the sink and the hob or fridge.",
  "advice.VENT_KITCHEN.title": "Kitchen ventilation: at least {flow} m³/h ({rn})",
  "advice.VENT_KITCHEN.why": "Romanian norm I5-2022 (table 6.1.1.1) requires {flow} m³/h kitchen extract for a home with {rooms} main rooms. In a block with a shared extract, the hood must not connect to the common duct.",
  "advice.VENT_KITCHEN.fix": "Choose a hood with at least this flow, ducted outside or recirculating.",
  "advice.FIXTURE_SIDE.title": "{nm} is too close sideways to a wall or another fixture ({rn})",
  "advice.FIXTURE_SIDE.why": "From the fixture's centreline to the obstacle is {d_m}; the NKBA guideline asks for at least {min_m} (recommended {rec_m}), otherwise it is awkward to use.",
  "advice.FIXTURE_SIDE.fix": "Move the fixture towards the centre or away from its neighbour.",
  "advice.SHOWER_SMALL.title": "The shower is too narrow ({rn})",
  "advice.SHOWER_SMALL.why": "{nm} has a side of {side_m}; NKBA asks for at least {min_m} inside (recommended {rec_m}).",
  "advice.SHOWER_SMALL.fix": "Choose an enclosure or walk-in shower of at least 80×80 cm, ideally 90×90.",
  "advice.BATH_ZONE.title": "Socket or switch too close to the shower ({rn})",
  "advice.BATH_ZONE.why": "The point is {d_m} from the shower; in zone 2 (0.60 m around a shower or bath) ordinary sockets and switches are not installed (Romanian norm I7 / HD 60364-7-701).",
  "advice.BATH_ZONE.fix": "Move the point more than {min_m} from the shower and check the solution with the electrician.",
  "advice.VENT_BATH.title": "The bathroom has no window: extract fan of at least {flow} m³/h ({rn})",
  "advice.VENT_BATH.why": "Without a window, moisture stays in the bathroom. Romanian norm I5-2022 (table 6.1.1.1) requires {flow} m³/h bathroom extract for this size of home.",
  "advice.VENT_BATH.fix": "Plan an extract fan (ideally with a timer or humidistat) and an air gap under the door.",
